  "大远景人物很小时可能检测不到。此时可以继续用参考拍摄，不会显示虚构的分数。点引导提示里的“比较背景站位”，或从设置进入：由你圈出可站区域，算法比较二维背景，不测量现实距离。": "Very small people may not be detected in extreme-wide scenes. You can still use the guides without a made-up score. Compare scene positions from guidance or settings, and mark a candidate standing area yourself. The planner only analyzes 2D pixels, not real-world distance.",
  "回到取景": "Return to camera",
  "本应用随安装包保留第三方库、模型及其许可文件。点击下方条目可在本机查看完整文本；不需要访问互联网。项目自有代码的 MIT 许可及详细来源记录见源码仓库。": "The package includes third-party libraries, models and license files. Tap below to read them locally without internet access. The source repository contains the project's MIT license and additional notices.",
  "BlazeFace short-range 官方模型卡明确标注 Apache License 2.0。模型和第三方库按其原始许可证使用，完整文本及来源可在本机查看。": "The official BlazeFace short-range model card specifies Apache License 2.0. Models and libraries remain subject to their upstream terms. Full notices are available locally.",
  "MediaPipe / BlazeFace · 来源说明": "MediaPipe / BlazeFace · Attribution",
