  "实际使用的技术": "Technologies in use",
  "人脸位置": "Face location",
  "MediaPipe Tasks Vision 0.10.14，CPU 路径。定位近处人脸；兼容路径是 face-api.js 0.22.2 的 TinyFaceDetector。当前应用不生成身份特征，不比对人脸库。": "MediaPipe Tasks Vision 0.10.14 uses a CPU-compatible path to locate nearby faces. The fallback is face-api.js 0.22.2 TinyFaceDetector. No identity embeddings or face recognition database are used.",
  "人体位置": "Person location",
  "TensorFlow.js 4.22.0 + COCO-SSD 2.2.3，优先在 Worker 的 CPU 上分析 person 类。框的底边中点近似脚点；不识别实际脚踝或完整骨架。": "TensorFlow.js 4.22.0 and COCO-SSD 2.2.3 detect person boxes, preferably on a CPU worker. The box bottom center approximates the foot point; real ankle joints or skeletons are not detected.",
  "构图与姿势": "Composition and poses",
  "本地几何规则与姿势库": "Local geometry and pose library",
  "7 种景别、8 种构图和 14 套关节火柴人。按所选景别、场景筛选排序，不调用生成模型。背景候选按当前动作的真实轮廓，比较用户指定区域的头肩边缘、明暗变化与构图距离。会联合检查人物占比、画幅边界和倍率，不自动判断地形、距离或站立安全。": "Seven shot sizes, eight composition layouts and fourteen jointed stick-figure poses are filtered by your chosen scene. No generative model is called. Background proposals compare pose outlines, edges, brightness and framing inside a user-selected area; they cannot judge terrain, distance or real-world safety.",
  "引导引擎 V6": "Guidance engine V6",
  "连续观测后再确认": "Confirming with multiple observations",
  "同一主体的观测平滑，保留原始出框检查；移动提示设切换缓冲。空结果、低置信度或超时会取消对齐，重复刷新不算新证据。多人采用几何连续选择，交叉遮挡时仍可能换人。": "Position tracking is smoothed while raw framing boundaries remain checked. Direction changes use a short debounce. Empty, low-confidence or stale observations clear alignment. Multiple people are tracked geometrically and may swap during occlusions.",
  "光线与风格": "Light and looks",
  "像素统计与本地颜色处理": "Pixel statistics and local color processing",
  "分析当前取景的亮度分布、高光和阴影比例、人物框内外亮度差与背景边缘；不使用环境语义模型，不测真实照度。曝光补偿按设备返回能力执行并核对实际读数。五种风格由可调整的明暗、对比、饱和与暖调组成，预览和成片共用参数。": "Analyzes pixel brightness, highlight and shadow proportions, differences inside and outside the subject box, and background edges. It does not measure lux or understand scene semantics. Exposure compensation requires supported device controls; five looks share the same adjustable parameters in preview and export.",
  "是否联网？": "Does it use the network?",
  "Android 离线安装包内置页面和模型，不申请联网权限。网页版首次打开和准备完整离线资源需要联网，全部校验完成后才显示就绪；缓存被浏览器清除后需重新准备。图像在设备内分析，应用没有照片上传接口。": "The Android APK bundles the page and models without requesting INTERNET permission. The web version needs network access to load and prepare all offline assets initially. If the browser clears storage, prepare again. Images are analyzed on-device; the app has no photo-upload endpoint.",
  "没有加入人体姿态估计模型，也没有重新训练这些检测模型。微调的是参考和时序引导规则，不能据此宣称识别准确率提高。": "No human pose-estimation model was added and the detection models were not retrained. The guidance and timing rules were tuned, which is not evidence of improved recognition accuracy.",
