  "已配置独立窗口显示与主屏幕图标。是否提供安装入口由手机浏览器决定；安装与实际相机表现仍需真机验证。": "Standalone display and home-screen icons are configured. Availability depends on the browser and device, and hardware behavior still requires testing.",
