  "拍摄使用实际相机视频帧。Android 版“保存照片”会打开系统文件保存位置；网页版根据支持情况提供分享或下载。取消保存后照片仍在预览中，未保存照片只保留在本次会话。设备变焦能力由当前摄像头与系统提供，未提供时使用数字裁剪。": "Photos are generated from actual camera video frames. Android saving opens the system file picker; browser sharing and downloading depend on available APIs. Cancelling save retains the preview, while unsaved photos stay in the current session. Device zoom is used where available, otherwise digital crop is applied.",
